under the chapter-specific namespace.  The earlier Brauer formalization
already contains the checked interfaces for the tensor-subspace, ideal,
matrix-module, and endomorphism constructions, so those declarations are
reused here.  In particular, the book's centralizer is represented directly
by Mathlib's `Subalgebra.centralizer`; no parallel centralizer definition is
introduced.
-/

